{\an8}TEAM BLUE CAPTAIN LEE DAEYOUNG

15
00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:58.592
{\an8}TEAM RED CAPTAIN KIM MINUK

16
00:00:58.659 --> 00:01:01.695
<i>The Six-on-Six Punching Race.</i>

17
00:01:01.762 --> 00:01:03.463
- A punching race? Great.
- Ah.

18
00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:05.165
All right.

19
00:01:07.301 --> 00:01:09.303
Team Lee Daeyoung. To be honest,

20
00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:12.339
you're coming into this round
as the underdogs.

21
00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:14.608
How are you feeling right now?

22
00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:16.109
Uh...

23
00:01:16.944 --> 00:01:19.246
Please select your opponent.

24
00:01:19.947 --> 00:01:21.381
We'd like to choose...

25
00:01:23.417 --> 00:01:24.484
Team Lee Daeyoung.

26
00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:25.719
- Oh!
- Yes!

27
00:01:25.786 --> 00:01:29.856
Team Lee Daeyoung looks
like the weakest team.

28
00:01:30.424 --> 00:01:32.159
If it's about stamina,

29
00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:34.595
we've got the advantage.

30
00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:36.196
Strength-wise, too.

31
00:01:36.263 --> 00:01:39.566
Honestly,
I don't see a world where we lose.

32
00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.704
