and teamwork look like.

33
00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.772
This is the rise of the underdogs.

34
00:01:47.474 --> 00:01:48.475
Great.

35
00:01:49.276 --> 00:01:52.646
We communicate well as a team,

36
00:01:52.713 --> 00:01:54.081
so I think we've got this.

37
00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:55.849
I was confident.

38
00:01:55.916 --> 00:01:58.385
The other team is going to lose for sure.

39
00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:01.388
I don't get why they think
we're pushovers.

40
00:02:01.455 --> 00:02:04.324
Kim Minuk's team is basically
like the Avengers.

41
00:02:04.391 --> 00:02:08.829
But the Avengers breaking under us,
that's what everyone wants to see.

42
00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:10.497
I thought, "Okay, bring it on.

43
00:02:10.564 --> 00:02:12.265
We'll hit back just as hard."

44
00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:14.801
We'll show you how the weakest take over.

45
00:02:15.369 --> 00:02:17.704
- We've got a real shot at this.
- Yeah, I agree.

46
00:02:17.771 --> 00:02:19.873
This round isn't just about skill.

47
00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:21.408
- It's comes down to grit.
- Right.

48
00:02:21.475 --> 00:02:22.643
Let's give this a shot.

49
00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:23.977
Wonder what their strategy is.

50
00:02:24.044 --> 00:02:26.947
Once you start hitting,
the strategy just writes itself.

51
00:02:27.014 --> 00:02:30.517
{\an8}- Punch like it's your last three minutes.
- Let's give it all we've got.

52
00:02:30.584 --> 00:02:32.319
{\an8}Prepare to see the underdogs rise.

53
00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:34.921
{\an8}We're giving this everything.

54
00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:37.124
{\an8}FIRST HALF, 1R
YOUNGWOONG, JUNYOUNG, MINUK

55
00:02:37.691 --> 00:02:39.726
<i>The Six-on-Six Punching Race.</i>

56
00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:43.463
<i>Team Kim Minuk versus Team Lee Daeyoung.</i>

57
00:02:44.498 --> 00:02:45.899
<i>Ready.</i>

58
