79
00:03:49.329 --> 00:03:50.597
So let's rapid-fire it.

80
00:03:51.098 --> 00:03:53.600
- Good idea.
- Yeah, that makes more sense.

81
00:03:54.167 --> 00:03:55.969
- He's a total ace.
- There you go.

82
00:03:56.036 --> 00:03:57.804
- Hit it fast!
- Yes, keep firing at it.

83
00:03:57.871 --> 00:03:58.872
You got this!

84
00:03:59.906 --> 00:04:01.241
You're crushing it!

85
00:04:04.411 --> 00:04:06.279
Doing great, Number One!

86
00:04:06.346 --> 00:04:08.215
- That's it!
- They're only doing straight shots.

87
00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:10.450
Team Blue is breezing through this.

88
00:04:10.517 --> 00:04:12.285
Short punches up top, guys!

89
00:04:13.386 --> 00:04:15.021
- You're almost there!
- Doing great!

90
00:04:15.856 --> 00:04:17.023
