- Okay.

169
00:07:41.461 --> 00:07:43.830
No hooks. Just one-two combos.

170
00:07:44.464 --> 00:07:45.565
Let's win this, guys!

171
00:07:45.632 --> 00:07:47.400
- Who's going first?
- I'll go.

172
00:07:47.901 --> 00:07:48.902
Huddle up.

173
00:07:48.969 --> 00:07:50.203
All right, guys.

174
00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:52.105
- Three, two, one! Let's go!
- Let's go!

175
00:07:52.172 --> 00:07:54.140
- Let's do this!
- Hey, gather around.

176
00:07:54.207 --> 00:07:56.076
- Three, two, one. Let's go!
- Let's go!

177
00:07:56.142 --> 00:07:58.812
Louder, guys! I can't hear you!

178
00:07:58.878 --> 00:08:02.315
I thought, "Stay focused until
the end, and we might actually win this."

179
00:08:03.917 --> 00:08:06.519
Even if it takes
everything I've got,

180
00:08:06.586 --> 00:08:08.955
