right from the start.

194
00:08:34.814 --> 00:08:36.883
- Keep going!
- Twelve left!

195
00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:39.686
- Yes, we're winning!
- Twelve left! Eleven left!

196
00:08:39.753 --> 00:08:41.321
When I saw that, I was convinced.

197
00:08:41.388 --> 00:08:42.956
We're moving up for sure.

198
00:08:45.191 --> 00:08:46.326
Okay, hit higher.

199
00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:48.762
Just move on to the next one!

200
00:08:50.463 --> 00:08:53.299
If he can't do it, they need to swap fast.

201
00:08:56.236 --> 00:08:57.237
You can come back now.

202
00:08:57.303 --> 00:08:59.973
- Let's switch!
- Yes, hit higher!

203
00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:01.074
{\an8}It's better to switch. Go.

204
00:09:01.141 --> 00:09:03.209
{\an8}TEAM RED
KIM JAEWON TO KIM SOOCHAN

205
00:09:04.811 --> 00:09:05.812
There we go.

206
00:09:06.312 --> 00:09:07.614
Hurry, time's almost up!

207
00:09:09.115 --> 00:09:11.151
Okay, nice. He's pretty fast.

208
00:09:11.217 --> 00:09:13.520
Great, he's powering through.

209
00:09:13.586 --> 00:09:14.721
This is more like it.

210
00:09:14.788 --> 00:09:15.789
Keep going!

211
00:09:21.494 --> 00:09:23.063
Almost there!

212
00:09:23.129 --> 00:09:25.832
If you're stuck,
just come back! Just finish that off!

213
00:09:26.332 --> 00:09:28.068
{\an8}- Come back. No, don't.
- It's okay.

214
00:09:28.134 --> 00:09:29.335
{\an8}- Go!
- All right!

215
00:09:29.402 --> 00:09:31.171
{\an8}As expected, Lee Dowoon's up next.

216
00:09:31.237 --> 00:09:33.306
He did really well earlier.

217
00:09:33.373 --> 00:09:34.808
Nice, keep going!

218
00:09:34.874 --> 00:09:36.309
You're smashing it!

219
00:09:37.077 --> 00:09:38.745
That's it! You got it!

220
00:09:38.812 --> 00:09:39.913
You're in the zone!

221
00:09:39.979 --> 00:09:41.614
You're doing awesome!

222
00:09:41.681 --> 00:09:43.583
- Keep it up until the end!
- That's it!

223
00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:44.717
All right!

224
00:09:46.486 --> 00:09:48.221
{\an8}TEAM RED
KIM SOOCHAN TO HONG JUNYOUNG

225
00:09:50.423 --> 00:09:52.459
Come on, keep pouring it out!

226
00:09:53.093 --> 00:09:54.194
Push harder!

227
00:09:54.894 --> 00:09:56.563
Let's go all the way!

228
00:09:57.997 --> 00:09:59.232
Last one! Hurry!

229
00:09:59.299 --> 00:10:00.867
- Last one!
- Last one!

230
00:10:00.934 --> 00:10:01.935
You're the star!

231
00:10:02.001 --> 00:10:03.169
This is your moment!

232
00:10:03.236 --> 00:10:06.106
- Yes, keep going!
- Finish that off and come back!

233
00:10:07.373 --> 00:10:08.942
MATCH OVER

234
00:10:10.176 --> 00:10:11.678
{\an8}<i>The match is over.</i>

235
00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:19.219
- All right!
- You're the star, man!

236
00:10:19.285 --> 00:10:21.221
- Yes!
- You did so good, man!

237
00:10:23.623 --> 00:10:26.126
Man, this really is an underdog uprising.

238
00:10:26.192 --> 00:10:28.862
Kim Minuk must be really disappointed,

239
00:10:28.928 --> 00:10:30.430
