- Oh, it feels amazing.

243
00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:41.441
They underestimated us
and picked us, right?

244
00:10:41.508 --> 00:10:45.612
I knew I wasn't as strong
as the other team captains,

245
00:10:45.678 --> 00:10:48.414
