1260
00:56:02.826 --> 00:56:04.394
Keep it up till the end!

1261
00:56:05.495 --> 00:56:06.964
Whoa, look at him.

1262
00:56:08.232 --> 00:56:09.633
{\an8}SEONGJUN X CHAEHYUN

1263
00:56:09.700 --> 00:56:11.735
{\an8}- Ten seconds, guys!
- Ten seconds!

1264
00:56:12.636 --> 00:56:14.071
{\an8}- Ten seconds!
